Package: ECMExplainerApp
Title: ECMExplainer: Functional Matrisome Ratios for Fibroblast Stress States
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Eleanor", "Sheekey", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(c("Roberto", "A."), "Avelar", role = "aut"),
    person("Hironobu", "Fujiwara", role = "aut"))
Description: Shiny application and reference implementation for ECMExplainer.
    Fibroblast transcriptomes are encoded as signs of matrisome gene-pair
    ratios and placed, through a frozen PCA and LDA, in a phenotype space of
    six reference states. Bundles the manuscript's ADSIG-180 model, the
    POOL-180 and ALLGENE-180 controls, the training cohort and the
    validation cohorts, and retrains panels on new data or gene lists.
